  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Under Duke Long’s qi breath mountain, Fang Yuan drops bandit monkey transformation for astral wind flying heavenly boar, stands on Myriad Year Flying Warship, and growls. Rampaging Qi Roar comes from Lang Ya Sect’s treasury. Lang Ya land spirit, controlling Heavenly Giant Solor, once used it against a sharp tusk boar and killed that ancient desolate beast with one move. With Fang Yuan’s one million five hundred thousand qi path dao marks, the power rises by one thousand five hundred times. The roar explodes the translucent mountain; currents become tornadoes across the battlefield, and Duke Long takes backlash.",
